{"id":"on09ufy5ssmr90ii2ihzl9acm","title":"内建关联法：思想之书·2·2","originalTitle":"思想之书·2·2、内建关联法","summary":"内建关联法是一种重要的方法论，通过将不同事物进行关联，揭示其根本联系，从而建立基本关联。这种方法在分析根本矛盾和表象矛盾时表现出色，揭示了自由与约束是最底层的根本矛盾。内建关联法与认知方法论相辅相成，共同构建思想的公理体系。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1767125&do=blog&id=1561634"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.782Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.782Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}